# Shoot First, Ask Questions Later (bastok 67): the offer without the gun. Marksmanship 2500: 795 (once per zone); its finish with a full
# inventory (no gun: giveItem false, not begun); a second talk in the zone falls to the default 500 (oncePerZone:
# priority Ignore); after a rezone 795 again and begun (the gun and the guide); then 796 with the gun held (hide 1)
# and its option 1 (the gun held: nothing).
lists Metalworks/Cid/onTrigger Metalworks/onEventFinish/795 Metalworks/onEventFinish/796
char zone=Metalworks pos=-12,-12,1 job=RNG lvl=75
skill Marksmanship 2500
login
trigger Cid                    # 795 (oncePerZone)
fill-inventory
finish                         # no gun, the inventory full: giveItem false, not begun
free-inventory
trigger Cid                    # 795 already played in this zone: priority Ignore, the default 500
finish
rezone
trigger Cid                    # after the rezone: 795 again
finish                         # the gun (0 points) and the Weapon Training Guide: accepted
trigger Cid                    # the gun held: 796 with hide 1
finish option=1                # option 1, the gun held: nothing
